@startuml lld-us17-sequence
title LLD-US17 Add a beneficiary: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant BeneficiaryService
participant IfscDirectory
Browser -> BeneficiaryService : POST /beneficiaries
BeneficiaryService -> IfscDirectory : lookup(SBIN0001234)
IfscDirectory --> BeneficiaryService : SBI, Pune
BeneficiaryService -> BeneficiaryService : cap = 50000 for 24 h
BeneficiaryService --> Browser : added
@enduml